  "help.text": "**🀄 How to play (type directly in your private thread)**\nOn your turn, type one of the following in your own private thread (the bot auto-deletes your message):\n\n**Discard**\n・Number tiles: `1m`~`9m` (man), `1p`~`9p` (pin), `1s`~`9s` (sou); case-insensitive\n・Red fives: `0m` / `0p` / `0s`\n・Honors: `e/s/w/n` = East/South/West/North, `r`=Chun, `wh`=Haku, `g`=Hatsu\n\n**Special actions**\n・Tsumo: `tsumo`\n・Riichi: `riichi 5m` (specify the tile to discard)\n・Ankan: `ankan 5m`\n・Kita (3-player): `!n`\n\n**Reacting to others' discards**\n・`ron`, `pon`, `chi 1` (pick by number), `kan`, `skip`",

